#### [MODIFY] [jobRoutes.js](file:///d:/new/Odito/odito_backend/src/modules/jobs/routes/jobRoutes.js)

Add `POST /api/jobs/domain-technical-report` route to store `DomainTechnicalReport` data.

#### [MODIFY] [jobController.js](file:///d:/new/Odito/odito_backend/src/modules/jobs/controller/jobController.js)

Add `storeDomainTechnicalReport` handler that validates and upserts the report into MongoDB.

